<title>USA: PaineWebber wins Jordan School District, Utah.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins Jordan School District, Utah.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $65 million of Board of Education of Jordan School District, Utah, general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.943 percent.</p>
</text>
